[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_h76km")
dialogue_id = "mq_4_20_begin"
record_title = "Era 四: The Avatar's Home"
text = "PAGE: explorer(STUDIO_SECONDARY), scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY), avatar_child(CONVERSATION)
explorer: I've brought the child, just like you asked.
explorer: The monks say the dates match perfectly.
scribe: It is as predicted.
scribe: When the time came, the sapling sprouted.
scribe: I hope you have kept our reasons discreet.
explorer: Oh, that wasn't a problem.
explorer: I was afraid of having to lie to the parents, but they didn't object at all.
explorer: They think it's an honor to be tutored by the great Scribe.
explorer: Which is all the monks told them...
scribe: Oh, it is I who shall be tutored.
scribe: But the divine spirit must yet be dormant, in one so young.
scribe: I shall awaken it to the best of my abilities.

PAGE: scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY), avatar_child(CONVERSATION), explorer(STUDIO_SECONDARY)
scribe: Thank you for agreeing to come, Your Holiness.
avatar_child: ...
scribe: It must have taken great courage to leave your parents and embark on this journey.
avatar_child: It was fun going through the gate!
scribe: Someday, when you are grown, we will need no gates to connect us.
scribe: When all the shards are reunited, we shall be able to simply walk.
scribe: Do you remember a time like that?
avatar_child: I walked everywhere before!
avatar_child: We had no gates.
scribe: So you remember...
avatar_child: I walked to the shrine!
avatar_child: And the market!
avatar_child: And the well!
avatar_child: And once we even went to the forest!
scribe: ...
scribe: No matter.
scribe: The memory will return in time.

PAGE: scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY), explorer(STUDIO_SECONDARY), avatar_child(CONVERSATION)
scribe: It is as I thought.
scribe: The divine spirit is yet to awaken within the child.
scribe: There is much work to be done.
explorer: I'll leave you to it, then!
scribe: Not so fast.
scribe: This place is not right for the child.
scribe: I am the last scholar remaining here.
scribe: Of course there's the Historian, but she...
scribe: Her order has lost faith before I was even born.
scribe: She wishes well, but her teachings may suppress the divinity.
scribe: No, we need an untouched shard.
scribe: A place for the Avatar to hear the voices of nature.
scribe: And scholars well-versed in ancient scripture to reawaken the memories.
explorer: That sounds like a plan.
explorer: I'll be going now.
scribe: You must prepare a new expedition.
scribe: And we will be coming with you."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
